<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><meta name="color-scheme" content="light"><title>A new month from Watergate Church</title></head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f4eee7;color:#342e28;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">
  <div style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;color:transparent;">Welcome to {{monthName}}. A new month and a new page to fill.</div>
  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="background:#f4eee7;"><tr><td align="center" style="padding:36px 14px;">
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="max-width:590px;background:#fff;">
      <tr><td align="center" style="padding:35px 28px 31px;background:#654b3b;color:#fff;">
        <p style="margin:0 0 12px;color:#edd7b7;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:1.6px;text-transform:uppercase;">A new chapter</p>
        <h1 style="margin:0;font:normal 30px/1.25 Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;">Welcome to {{monthName}}</h1>
      </td></tr>
      <tr><td style="padding:30px 36px 34px;">
        <p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;">Hello {{recipientName}},</p>
        <p style="margin:0 0 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;">A new month opens a little more space for purpose, connection, and the good things still ahead. We hope it brings you renewed hope and peace.</p>
        {{#if monthMessage}}<p style="margin:0 0 22px;padding:17px 19px;background:#f7f3ed;border:1px solid #eadfce;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;">{{monthMessage}}</p>{{/if}}
        {{#if bibleVerse}}<blockquote style="margin:0;padding:0 0 0 20px;border-left:3px solid #bb8955;color:#654b3b;"><p style="margin:0;font:italic 19px/1.55 Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;">&ldquo;{{bibleVerse}}&rdquo;</p>{{#if bibleReference}}<footer style="margin-top:12px;color:#715d4b;font:700 12px Arial,sans-serif;">{{bibleReference}}</footer>{{/if}}</blockquote>{{/if}}
        <p style="margin:24px 0 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;">May your plans find steady ground, and may you and your household experience a month of blessing.</p>
      </td></tr>
      <tr><td align="center" style="padding:18px 30px;background:#f7f3ed;color:#6e6257;font:12px/1.6 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Warm wishes from Watergate Church Global<br>&copy; {{year}}</td></tr>
    </table>
  </td></tr></table>
</body>
</html>
